    "body": "We're okay with circular dependencies between specs I guess.\r\n\r\nIDB would still need to associate the \"jobs\" with the event loop in some way without monkey patching. Would defining that as a map _event loop &rarr; list of transaction cleanup jobs_ in IDB be appropriate? And the \"Cleanup Indexed Database transactions\" would \"pass\" the event loop in?",
